        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-cornus-controversa-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-cornus-controversa-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-cornus-controversa-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-cornus-controversa-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
